# SPEC-BINDING Values

These values are documented in SPEC-v1.md with `<!-- SPEC-BINDING -->` markers.
Changing them in code without updating the spec causes drift.

## Current SPEC-BINDING Values
| ID | Value | Where in Code |
|---|---|---|
| NFR-1.2 | CURRENCY_SCALE=2, RATE_SCALE=6 | BigDecimal operations |
| FR-5.2 | EMERGENCY_FUND_TARGET_MONTHS=6 | ArthaProperties, EmergencyFundCalculator |
| FR-6.1 | EPF_TAX_THRESHOLD=250000 | TaxService.EPF_TAX_THRESHOLD |
| FR-7.7 | STALE_DATA_THRESHOLD_DAYS=90 | StaleDataService.STALE_THRESHOLD_DAYS |
| NFR-8.2 | CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000 | application.yml, WebConfig |

## Rule
Before changing ANY of these values:
1. Check `docs/SPEC-v1.md` for the documented value
2. If the change is intentional → update the spec FIRST, then the code
3. Add an entry to the Spec Change Log in the spec file
4. Never leave code and spec out of sync
